sequenceDiagram
    actor Browser
    participant API as Spring Boot
    participant Redis
    participant QC as QuestionClassifier
    participant QIC as QueryIntentClassifier
    participant Qdrant
    participant Cohere
    participant Claude as Claude Haiku

    Browser->>API: POST /api/chat/stream

    API->>API: Rate limit check (5/min · 20/day per IP)

    API->>QC: classify(question)
    alt INVALID / OUT_OF_SCOPE / STRATEGIC / CONTACT
        API-->>Browser: SSE early-return message + done
    end

    API->>Redis: GET session turn count
    alt Turn limit reached (30 turns)
        API-->>Browser: SSE limit message + done
    end

    Note over API: Query Preparation
    API->>Redis: GET conversation history (last 2 turns)
    API->>API: Extract focus company from question + history
    API->>API: Multi-query expansion → resolve ambiguous pronouns
    API->>API: Resolve sibling companies (e.g. OCBC → [Sanofi, Deloitte])

    Note over API,QIC: Strategy Selection (selectStrategy)
    alt Multi-company question? (focusCompany=null + “past few jobs” signals)
        API->>API: Strategy → MULTI_COMPANY
        Note right of API: Per-company targeted search (2 hits each), no rerank, enforce diversity
        loop Each known company
            API->>Qdrant: Hybrid search (dense + sparse, limit=2, company filter)
            Note right of Qdrant: Behavioral-themed? → add intent_tags scoring boost
        end
        Qdrant-->>API: 2 candidates per company, deduped by (docId:chunkIndex)
        API->>API: Enforce company diversity (min 1 hit per company)
    else BEHAVIORAL / TECHNICAL
        API->>QIC: classify intents (rule-based → LLM fallback)
        QIC-->>API: 1-3 intent_tags (e.g. [growth, conflict, leadership])
        API->>API: Strategy → BEHAVIORAL
        Note right of API: Global hybrid search + Cohere rerank (minScore cutoff)
        API->>Qdrant: Hybrid search (RRF fusion, candidateK=limit×2)
        Note right of Qdrant: must=[company], should=[intent_tags] scoring boost
        Qdrant-->>API: RRF-ranked candidates
        API->>Cohere: Rerank (rerank-v3.5, minScore=0.18)
        Cohere-->>API: Top-N by cross-encoder score
    else FACTUAL — temporal / profile
        API->>API: Strategy → FACTUAL_TEMPORAL / FACTUAL_PROFILE
        Note right of API: Hybrid search only, no intent filter, no rerank
        API->>Qdrant: Hybrid search
        Qdrant-->>API: Candidates
    else FACTUAL — experience
        API->>API: Strategy → FACTUAL_EXPERIENCE
        Note right of API: Hybrid search + rerankTopN (no minScore cutoff)
        API->>Qdrant: Hybrid search
        Qdrant-->>API: Candidates
        API->>Cohere: Rerank (rerankTopN, no minScore)
        Cohere-->>API: Top-N
    end

    API->>API: Company allowlist post-filter (focus + siblings + parent)
    Note right of API: e.g. OCBC → allow [OCBC, Sanofi, Deloitte]. Chunks carrying other companies excluded.

    API-->>Browser: SSE event:sources (chunk previews)

    API->>API: Assemble prompt (system + typeHint + history + context + question)
    API->>Claude: Streaming generate (claude-haiku, maxTokens=800)

    loop Per token
        Claude-->>API: token
        API-->>Browser: SSE event:message
    end

    API->>Redis: Append Q&A to conversation history
    API-->>Browser: SSE event:done
